{"parse": {"title": "GM-08", "pageid": 93625, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/GM-07\" title=\"GM-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">GM-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">GM</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AE.97.E5.B0.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"算尽\">算尽</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 算尽</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Didn't See That Coming</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>熟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>知<span class=\"color-value\"></span>礼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>节<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>就<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>意<span class=\"color-value\"></span>外<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>获<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>另外两个协会的成员，已经核查过了，他们是你师父诱饵的一部分。为了把你从唐人街赶走，才加入了这个计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>还有，那些审理事件报告的职员，对你没有采取说服手段，引起激烈冲突的行动颇有微词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>不过，毕竟这三个始作俑者都是托你的帮助才送进了警局，我花了点时间说服了他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>切……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她翻了个白眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>那今次我解决事件的报酬嘞？你们不会讲话不算数吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>别指望有折头啊！过年没抬价已经是老熟客的超级优惠了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸垮得越来越厉害，怨鬼般瞪着对方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>接着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一叠厚厚的红色信封丢到了她的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>我听Z女士说过这是你们那边的礼仪，后勤部没有采购过那个称作“红包”的东西，我花了点时间才找到这种红色的信封。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阴影一扫而空，女孩的眼中顿时冒出了金光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一手钩住了男孩，仿若过命的交情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>哇，不用这么客气啦！多谢晒啊老板！嘿嘿，祝你们圣洛夫基金会——招财进宝、万事如意啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>我还是好欢迎圣洛夫基金会的各位大驾光临，莅临指导的！特别是你们那个Z女士啦，得闲过来饮茶啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她边说着，扭头打开信封，鬼鬼祟祟地瞥了一眼，这才放心地塞进了口袋里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>恐怖通老兄，不管有咩吩咐！我新科学除灵驱鬼事务所一定一呼百应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>噢，谢谢提醒！我确实有一些问题需要你的解答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>什么……我<span style=\"font-size:91%\">明</span><span style=\"font-size:83%\">明只是客套而已啦……你还真有问题啊</span>。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女背过头喃喃低语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>我听说在你们那里，师徒情谊是很重要的事——叫什么“一日为师，终身为父”？但明明是亲手把师父送进监狱，你看上去似乎并不难受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>挺上道的嘛，老兄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>噢，我对在道德上谴责你不感兴趣，这只是出于个人角度的好奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女的笑容收敛了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>我想，是因为他最后向我道谢了吧，那个胡子拉碴，把我视作祸害的师父。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>他同我讲——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>“多谢你把我从井底拉出来，豆丁。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>我就觉得，其实他也好开心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>哎呀，日光日白这么煽情，丑死人了，大佬！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>什么？井底是什么意思？我没有听明白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摆了摆手，没有管他的话，自顾自地离去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>自己顿悟啦，老兄！我该走啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>说起来，我怎么总感觉忘了什么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>哼～哼♫</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩轻快的步伐，在忙得焦头烂额的职员之中，显得格外瞩目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这是和Z女士来自同一个地方的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>呼……呼，放轻松，马库斯，就像平常那样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她鼓起勇气，挡在了泥鯭的士前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>嗯？做咩啊，靓女。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>恭、恭喜发财！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>不是吧，谁教你的啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泥鯭的士向后退了一步，突然的拜年犹如夜袭，向来能令口袋窘迫的大人手足无措。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>哼，不过，你、你失算了吧！我还未到要给你发红包的年纪！你挑错对象啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光如此澄澈，就像是一只躲在纸箱里的弃养魔精，瞪着豆大而又困惑的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泥鯭的士尽量撇过脸，试图回避，却终于熬不住那双眼，缴械投降了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>……算啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>恭喜发财啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不情不愿，从信封里抽出一张钞票，郑重地递交到马库斯的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:125%\">就</span><span style=\"font-size:116%\">只</span><span style=\"font-size:108%\">有</span>这些啦，不会再<span style=\"font-size:83%\">多给了</span>！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿若是落入了虎穴之中，她逃窜起来卷起一阵烟尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>徒留下，在原地不知所措的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>呃……诶？诶？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_louceng1\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_louceng1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_louceng1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊中，一阵阵低沉的哀鸣，以及捶打声回荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>居民聚集起来，窃窃私语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">租客：</div><div>我就讲嘛……自从那个女孩失踪以后，这个屋子里就好不吉利，所以才会传出这样的声音……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">租客Ⅱ：</div><div>听说包租婆都被吓得神志不清，所以这两天才没有看见她过来收租……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">租客：</div><div>唉！少讲一句啦！多亏里面那只鬼把包租婆吓跑，不然过年又要找我们涨租。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他点燃纸钞，连连拜了几拜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-624320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">租客：</div><div>鬼老兄，多谢帮忙啦！你好好待在里面，我们会好吃好喝供着你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处传来了悠然的口哨，以及脚步声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>嗯？今天这么热闹！看来有生意上门啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>新科学除灵驱鬼事务所，<span style=\"font-size:119%\">开张</span>！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "GM-08"}}